{"step_index":10925,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T16:23:20Z","thinking":"Progress modal visibility depends on `screenId` and the `isProcessRunning` flag. Specifically, if the screen ID matches 'screen-new' and a process is active, the progress modal should be displayed. Verification includes ensuring the progress modal element exists before attempting to change its display style.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Handle screen-new scroll and overflow state on screen navigation\"","EndLine":"3647","Instruction":"\"Ensure screenNew overflow and scroll position are handled properly when navigating screens\"","ReplacementContent":"\"            const progressModal = document.getElementById('progress-modal');\\n            const screenNewEl = document.getElementById('screen-new');\\n            if (screenId === 'screen-new') {\\n                if (typeof isProcessRunning !== 'undefined' && isProcessRunning) {\\n                    if (progressModal) progressModal.style.display = 'flex';\\n                    if (screenNewEl) {\\n                        screenNewEl.scrollTop = 0;\\n                        screenNewEl.style.overflowY = 'hidden';\\n                    }\\n                } else {\\n                    if (progressModal) progressModal.style.display = 'none';\\n                    if (screenNewEl) screenNewEl.style.overflowY = 'auto';\\n                    resetNewProcessForm();\\n                }\\n            } else {\\n                if (progressModal) progressModal.style.display = 'none';\\n                if (screenNewEl) screenNewEl.style.overflowY = 'auto';\\n                if (screenId === 'screen-logs' || screenId === 'screen-settings') {\\n                    loadLogs();\\n                } else if (screenId === 'screen-servers') {\\n                    loadServersUI();\\n                    loadServerLogs();\\n                }\\n            }\"","StartLine":"3630","TargetContent":"\"            const progressModal = document.getElementById('progress-modal');\\n            if (screenId === 'screen-new') {\\n                if (typeof isProcessRunning !== 'undefined' && isProcessRunning) {\\n                    if (progressModal) progressModal.style.display = 'flex';\\n                } else {\\n                    if (progressModal) progressModal.style.display = 'none';\\n                    resetNewProcessForm();\\n                }\\n            } else {\\n                if (progressModal) progressModal.style.display = 'none';\\n                if (screenId === 'screen-logs' || screenId === 'screen-settings') {\\n                    loadLogs();\\n                } else if (screenId === 'screen-servers') {\\n                    loadServersUI();\\n                    loadServerLogs();\\n                }\\n            }\"","TargetFile":"\"D:/AI_Engineer/Pharmacy-agy-vision/desktop_app/templates/index.html\"","toolAction":"\"Updating showScreen screen-new handling\"","toolSummary":"\"Update showScreen screen-new handling\""}}]}
